<newsitem itemid="746897" id="root" date="1997-07-22" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Dexia Hypo sets 100 mln mark structured bond.</title>
<headline>Dexia Hypo sets 100 mln mark structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by sole manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEXIA HYPOTHEKENBANK BERLIN AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.625    MATURITY    25.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    25.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	TO 25.SEP.97 THEN PAYS 4.25 PCT IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		SHORT FIRST COUPON. OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 594.</p>
<p>		DEXIA HYPO LAUNCHED A SIMILAR 150 MLN MARK BOND</p>
<p>		EARLIER TODAY, ALSO VIA DRESDNER KLEINWORT BENSON.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
